      "description": "The Veezu booking app is the quickest and simplest way to request a ride from your local service. Book a ride in seconds with the Veezu app.\n\n► SMARTER LOCAL RIDES START WITH VEEZU\nBook in just 2 taps across the UK with a local Driver Partner - quicker and easier than a phone call!\n\n• Download the app and register to use Veezu.\n• Book your ride in a range of locations across the UK. \n• Customise your favourite pickup and drop-off points or choose from recent journeys.\n• Pre-book your trip in advance or request a driver-partnerASAP to get a low-cost trip to your destination.\n\n► PAY SIMPLY AND SEAMLESSLY IN-APP OR IN PERSON\n• With the NEW Veezu booking app you can pay for your ride service by Card, AirPay, Google Pay, Apple Pay.\n• Or Pay cash directly to the driver-partner.\n• Driver-partners accept cash, giving you ultimate flexibility on how you pay.\n\n► YOUR SAFETY IS OUR PRIORITY\n• When you book your ride with Veezu, your safety is our priority. \n• We always share the driver-partners’ information, car registration, make, model and colour with you as soon as your booking is confirmed.\n• We also track your car to give you updated arrival time, showing the route and drop-off point.\n\nFrequently asked questions;\n\n► HOW DO I BOOK MY RIDE WITH VEEZU?\nWhether you're looking to arrive at your next destination as soon as possible, pre-book your trip, request a ride, or book an airport transfer, Veezu can match you with a local driver-partner in seconds.\n\n• Enter your destination to receive an instant fare estimate and arrival time.\n• When you request a ride, we’ll notify you as soon as your car is dispatched and inform you of your allocated driver-partner.\n• We will also track your car to give you an ETA en-route and to your drop-off point, with additional safety details including car registration, make, model and colour.\n\n► CAN I BOOK AN AIRPORT TRANSFER?\nAbsolutely - booking with Veezu is simple! You can pre-book your airport trip through the Veezu app. We’ll show the confirmed booking in your app, along with the pick-up point and time, estimated arrival and journey time.\n\n► WHICH TOWNS AND CITIES WE COVER?\nVeezu is the UK's fastest-growing private hire technology platform with more than 16,000+ active driver-partners across hundreds of towns and cities, including:\n• Barnsley\n• Barry\n• Bath\n• Birmingham\n• Bradford\n• Bridgend\n• Bristol\n• Broadland\n• Cambridge\n• Cardiff\n• Chesterfield\n• Chippenham\n• Cwmbran\n• Derby\n• Doncaster\n• Dronfield\n• Dudley\n• Earlestown\n• Huntingdon\n• Knowsley\n• Leeds\n• Liverpool\n• Newport\n• Newton Le Willows\n• Norwich\n• Oldbury\n• Oswestry\n• Pontypool\n• Rotherham\n• Runcorn\n• Sefton\n• Sheffield\n• Shrewsbury\n• Solihull\n• South Gloucester\n• St Helens\n• St Neots\n• Swindon\n• Telford\n• Torfaen\n• Vale of Glamorgan\n• Wakefield\n• Walsall\n• Warrington\n• Wednesbury\n• Wetherby\n• Wigan\n• Willenhall\n• Wiltshire\n• Wolverhampton\n\n-------------------------------------------------\n\n> Visit our Social Media platforms & Website\nhttps://www.veezu.co.uk/\nhttps://www.facebook.com/veezugroup\nhttps://www.instagram.com/veezu/\nhttps://twitter.com/veezu/\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/company/veezu/ \n\n> Any Suggestions? \nContact us with issues or features suggestions on \"info@veezu.co.uk\"\n\n> Terms & Conditions: https://www.veezu.co.uk/legal/terms-and-services.pdf\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.veezu.co.uk/legal\nFAQ: https://www.veezu.co.uk/ride/help",
